{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-19",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "解放工作狂老板  (Liberating the Workaholic Boss)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Impressed by the team's flawless preparation, Chun Yuqiao cracks a rare joke—and admits he has a personal visit he nearly cancelled this morning. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们这么用功，是要得小红花啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你知不知道有的时候你的笑话真的挺老？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "董事长交代过了，把你从工作狂的状态中解放出来是全公司的任务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "从今天开始你就放轻松，踏踏实实地坐收我们带来的工作果实吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果真的不需要我全程监控的话，我倒是想出去一趟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "孩子过来了，只有今天上午的机会可以见面，我本来是推了的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "必须得去啊！大直播一年有七八回，她三年才回趟国，你怎么能推了呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那我出去一趟，待一会儿就回来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "待什么一会儿，快去吧，一天半天的都没问题！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，刚才说的那位是谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大的闺女啊，是个混血儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么？淳于总都已经有个闺女了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有啊，都五岁了，一直跟她后爹在国外生活。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这关我什么事啊？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们这么用功，是要得小红花啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Working this diligently—are you hoping to win a little red star?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你知不知道有的时候你的笑话真的挺老？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, do you realise your jokes are pretty dated sometimes?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "董事长交代过了，把你从工作狂的状态中解放出来是全公司的任务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chairwoman gave orders that freeing you from workaholic mode is the whole company's mission.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "从今天开始你就放轻松，踏踏实实地坐收我们带来的工作果实吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Starting today, just relax and calmly reap the fruits of your staff's hard work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果真的不需要我全程监控的话，我倒是想出去一趟。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you truly do not need me monitoring the whole process, I actually would like to step out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "孩子过来了，只有今天上午的机会可以见面，我本来是推了的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is in town and only free to meet this morning; originally I had turned it down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "必须得去啊！大直播一年有七八回，她三年才回趟国，你怎么能推了呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have to go! Big broadcasts happen seven or eight times a year, whereas she visits once in three years—how could you cancel?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那我出去一趟，待一会儿就回来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I will step out for a bit and come right back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "待什么一会儿，快去吧，一天半天的都没问题！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Forget just a bit—hurry along, taking half a day or a full day is fine!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥，刚才说的那位是谁啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen, who was that person you two just mentioned?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大的闺女啊，是个混血儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss's daughter—she is mixed-race.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么？淳于总都已经有个闺女了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? Chun Yuqiao already has a daughter?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "有啊，都五岁了，一直跟她后爹在国外生活。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sure does—she is five already and lives abroad with her stepfather.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这关我什么事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What does that have to do with me anyway?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们这么用功，是要得小红花啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
