    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After shooing Chun Yuqiao out the door, Kaiwen casually reveals that the visitor is Chun Yuqiao's five-year-old daughter living abroad, leaving Bu Xiaogu stunned. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
